## Cells ext3.1–ext3.2 — Extension 3: Covariate Ablation (Stage 4)

These cells complete Stage 4 of the thesis (Dunnhumby covariate attribution).
Extension 3 trains 4 covariate variants on Dunnhumby and computes SHAP values
to quantify the marginal contribution of demographics and campaign exposure.

| Variant | Static covariates | Dynamic covariates |
|---------|------------------|--------------------|
| `none`  | — | — |
| `static` | income, household size | — |
| `dynamic` | — | coupon redemptions, campaign flag |
| `full`  | income, household size | coupon redemptions, campaign flag |

**Prerequisites:** `none` + `static` already done locally. This cell trains `dynamic` + `full`.
`ext3.2` runs SHAP attribution on the best `full` checkpoint (seed 42).

**Runtime:** ext3.1 ≈ 1–2 h; ext3.2 ≈ 10–20 min.
# ── ext3.1 — Train Extension 3 dynamic + full covariate variants ──────────────
# Already done (skip_existing): extension3_lstm_none, extension3_lstm_static,
#   extension3_transformer_none, extension3_transformer_static (3 seeds each).
# This cell trains the remaining dynamic and full variants (3 seeds × 4 configs = 12 runs).
